# Ruleset: Alibaba
#
# Expects a mainland policy.
#
# Commerce, payments, cloud, DingTalk, Amap and device fingerprint hosts. alicdn.com lives in Direct/CDNChina.list; Youku in Media/Youku.list. UC Browser and Quark hosts under ucweb.com, uc.cn and myquark.cn belong on the mainland path; Quark download hosts stay in Direct/Download.list. Its security SDK, device fingerprint and device identifier hosts are listed in source/protected.json so no reject list can take them, and the anycast space the apps dial by address is in Geo/AlibabaCIDR.list.

# Alibaba
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alibaba.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alibaba-inc.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alibabachengdun.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alibabachengdun.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alibabausercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alidns.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alikunlun.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,marmot-cloud.com

